Third-party data used by the AWS catalog (mvp/server/catalog/aws)

1. AWS Service Reference JSON
   https://servicereference.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/
   First-party AWS data, used under the AWS site terms. Snapshots under
   snapshots/<date>/services/ are stored verbatim.

2. iam-dataset
   https://github.com/iann0036/iam-dataset
   Pinned in iam-dataset.lock (commit and SHA-256 of aws/iam_definition.json).
   Used for dependent actions and the access-level string.
